{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10370070","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10370070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1037007001:1":{"text":"汚染じゃ！この先は汚染されとる。恐ろしい汚染で地面が真っ黒に染まったんじゃ。","source_cn":"污染！前面出现了可怕的污染，那污染会将土地变成黑色。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9742EAB5DA7A63D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1037007002:1":{"text":"それだけではない。あの周りでは、本来大人しいはずの動物たちまで狂暴化しておる。","source_cn":"不仅如此，就连周围原本温顺的动物都会得狂躁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3C44E5D70EE4985","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1037007003:1":{"text":"サウスロープ村に避難した方がいい。これ以上進むと危険じゃ。","source_cn":"你们快去南坡村躲躲吧，不要让自己陷入危险之中。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05109E1D6E24BE2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1037007004:1":{"text":"こうしている間も汚染は近づいてきておる。わしもサウスロープ村に引っ越すべきかのう……","source_cn":"现在污染正向着我这边蔓延……我要不要也搬回南坡村呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F68AB59DFC43859","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民契尔曼":{"text":"村人のチェルマン","source":"村民契尔曼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}